# Git attributes for ICONTECH Gadgets & Repair Management
# Ensures Git and GitHub handle images and binary assets cleanly without corruption

# Binary image formats - never convert line endings or filter
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.avif binary

# Vector images and web assets
*.svg text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
